/issues/comments/2576122990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101243#issuecomment-2576122990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101243","id":2576122990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZjIRu","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T20:01:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T20:12:54Z","body":"> That's pretty strange, the most of the work in the get_height seems to be spent on loading font (woff decompression), which should only happen once per font config/size, subsequent calls should not do much\r\n\r\nStrange indeed; if that is the case this PR is probably the wrong approach to fix this. I'll mark it as draft until we know if there isn't a better way to do this.\r\n\r\nEdit: `BrotliDecoderCompress` seems to be about half the compute time of `get_height` for me in both scenarios; the other half is mangled names. So probably the same as what you are seeing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576122990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1